      "value": "@{5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715|full_name}: Here is a repro case if you want to import it directly: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1va6emDExsgg70FcFAMlvTTnqKHSj38hQ/view?usp=sharing\nOtherwise here are my steps:\n1. Create a New Project\n2. Import VRCSDK3\n3. Import Udon (unused, but might be part of the problem somehow)\n4. Create an empty game object at the root of the hiearchy, then create a nested cube underneath and attached VRC Pickup and VRC Object Sync to the cube\n5. Create a cube at the root of the hierarchy and attach VRC Pickup and VRC Object Sync to the cube\n6. Add VRCWorld prefab.\nNote that two users are required to demonstrate the bug. The nested pickup will not be properly synced when picked up. The pickup on the root will be properly synced.",
